2.5 Heat Transfer
The heat transfer can be evaluated with the dimensionless variable called Nusselt number (N u). It describes the ratio between convective and conductive heat transfer at a boundary, Equation 2.8, where the hydraulic diameter Dh is used as the characteristic length for internal channel flow.
